GIT ADD
=======

Stage files for commit.


BASIC
-----
git add file.txt

Adds one file to staging area.


OPTIONS
-------
Add all changes:
  git add .

Add specific files:
  git add file1.txt file2.txt

Add by pattern:
  git add *.js


WHAT IT DOES
------------
• Prepares files for commit
• Tells Git to track changes
• Required before git commit


ERRORS
------
"not a git repository"  → Run git init first
"pathspec did not match" → File doesn't exist
